menu "sys_flasher"

    config SYS_FLASHER_EN_PIN
        int "EN wire (GPIO)"
        default 3
        range 0 48
        help
          Joined to the EN (RST) pin of the board on the link. Driven push-pull:
          low resets that board, high keeps it running. Its RST button is not
          used while this wire is joined.

    config SYS_FLASHER_BOOT_PIN
        int "BOOT wire (GPIO)"
        default 46
        range 0 48
        help
          Joined to GPIO 0 (BOOT) of the board on the link. Low while EN
          rises starts that board's ROM bootloader. Push-pull, as EN.

    config SYS_FLASHER_BAUD
        int "Rate while flashing"
        default 921600
        range 115200 2000000
        help
          The ROM bootloader starts at 115200; CHANGE_BAUD takes it to this
          rate for the writes.

    config SYS_FLASHER_TASK_STACK
        int "Task stack (bytes)"
        default 4096
        range 3072 16384

    config SYS_FLASHER_TASK_PRIO
        int "Task priority"
        default 3
        range 1 10
        help
          Below the router's and the stream's tasks: flashing waits on the
          line, and nothing waits on it.

endmenu
